SUMMARY:Historic Churches of Toronto (NEW SERIES FOR 2026) 
DESCRIPTION:Toronto History Walks\n**The Toronto History Walks Yearly Pass
  is available. Get it now for $125.00 for 1 year of unlimited tours\, emai
 l**\n[torontohistorywalks@gmail.com](http://torontohistorywalks@gmail.com%
 2A%2A/)\n**for more information or for signing up!**\n\n**Please note: Ple
 ase e-transfer the ticket amount when booking your space for this tour! Yo
 u can e-transfer to the following email at:**\n[torontohistorywalks@gmail.
 com](http://torontohistorywalks@gmail.com%2A%2A/)\n\n**This new series of 
 10 walks explores Toronto and its historic churches. It is re-designed and
  ready to go! And we start with Parkdale.**\n\nThe history of any modern c
 ity is fascinating\, but the history of religion and the individual church
 es tell a gripping story that runs parallel to the rise of the city. Toron
 to and its churches tell that story in great detail\, and what society val
 ued most\, and how it changed\, and how we evolved.\n\nEach church was at 
 the core of the district and the history of the neighbourhood reflected th
 at. The church was the gathering spot in times of trouble and in times of 
 celebration. But what did these churches play in the history of "Toronto t
 he Good?"\n\nOn this walk 1 of the series\, let's take a walk around Parkd
 ale and explore some of the old existing churches and discuss the roles th
 ey played in the development of the Floral Suburb.\n\nSome churches are go
 ne\, but not forgotten. Others have been lovingly renovated and restored\,
  and they still grace our streets today.\n\nOur next walk in the series wi
 ll explore the Junction area to the west.\n\nThe tour begins outside Toron
 to Public Library - Parkdale Branch. We end the tour at St. Vincent de Pau
 l Church on Roncesvalles Avenue.\n\nThis tour has a ticket price of $15.00
  per person!\n\n\\*\\* **Please note: Please e-transfer the ticket price w
 hen booking your space for this tour! You can e-transfer to the following 
 email at:**\n**torontohistorywalks@gmail.com**
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/the-history-of-parkdale/events/315254
 073/
